# The LGD parser golden test asserts byte-equality between the parser's LF
# output and these committed fixtures/goldens (backend/tests/test_lgd_parser.py).
# Pin LF so a contributor with core.autocrlf=true cannot reintroduce CRLF and
# break the deterministic-re-run / golden-file gates.
*.csv text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.xlsx binary
